# Copy into a PROJECT repo root as `.semgrepignore` to exclude PATHS from SAST.
# (To silence a single finding in code, prefer an inline comment on that line:
#   // nosemgrep: <rule-id>  -- with a short justification next to it.)
# Semgrep picks this file up automatically from the repo root.

# Default-style exclusions:
build/
.dart_tool/
node_modules/
vendor/
